{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122836","id":4366478440,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBEMsaA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122836","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122836.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122836.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122836","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122836/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122836/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122836/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e7f66e93bd9e1087107745b6b8af1d060d7c9b71","number":122836,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"ScriptCreateDialog: Make validation messages clearer","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123874\r\n- Quite messy/complicated logic\r\n- Weird error combinations\r\n- Partially supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110292\r\n- Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123876\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\nNow each line has a clear goal (not combined, as it was before):\r\n\r\n- (new) `MSG_ID_INHERITED_PARENT`: Check if the \"Inherits:\" is a valid Object.\r\n- `MSG_ID_PATH`: Check if the path is valid.\r\n- `MSG_ID_SCRIPT`: Check if the file already exists, is built-in, can load an existing script.\r\n\r\nAlso forced the button text to be \"Create\" instead of \"Load\" if `load_enabled = false`.\r\n\r\nThis also accidentally fixed the bug where you can't select templates when the script already exists but reusing one is not allowed.\r\n\r\n## Sample screenshots\r\n\r\n| BEFORE | AFTER |\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n| <img width=\"501\" height=\"454\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d31bc883-8461-4533-9344-f7d7ca87abca\" /> | <img width=\"504\" height=\"451\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1743085-35ae-452d-a9cf-db626c6df1e4\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"502\" height=\"455\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b45d2109-2202-4d1e-a40e-a2f1b55c86e9\" /> | <img width=\"500\" height=\"428\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0991b620-ad0c-4a4c-be00-ce40a719323a\" /> | \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nTried to reuse messages where applicable (to avoid translation work). No AI was used.\r\n\r\nAlso changed the message when templates were disabled from \"Empty\" to \"Disabled\". Can remove this if deemed too far out-of-scope.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"i